WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.380
I take it this guy is my opponent?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.130
Hi. The name's Lum.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.460
We're getting married, baby!

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.790
If you absolutely insist...

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.380
then I'll marry you.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.380
I'm going to live here!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.960
I'm all yours now, darling!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.040
He has a big scythe.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.750
His job is guiding wandering souls

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.500
Awww, darling!
His job is guiding wandering souls<b></b>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.080
His job is guiding wandering souls

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:39.210
to the circle of reincarnation.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.790
Darling! Darling!
to the circle of reincarnation.<b></b>

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:42.880
to the circle of reincarnation.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.420
C'mon, darling!
He always wears a tracksuit.<b></b>

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.080
Let's ditch this boring class and go have fun!
He always wears a tracksuit.<b></b>

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.250
MOROBOSHI!

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.920
THIS ISN'T A BIKINI BAR, DOGGONE IT!

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.420
Well, I sure as hell didn't bring her here!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.710
Married couples never spend a minute apart!

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:59.670
I hate this so much!

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.330
Why do they have to spite me all the time?!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.330
You've got it wrong!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.670
Enough of your excuses!

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.790
How dare you!
Treating Earth women like yesterday's garbage!

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.040
Yeah! How dare you!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.330
Darling...

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.630
Smoooooch!

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.630
<b>Smooch!</b>

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Ataru! You scumbag!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.330
Quit forcing our pure Lum
into doing your lewd bidding!

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:19.250
Shaddup!

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.170
Are you morons blind or what?!

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.170
<b>Bonk</b>

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.290
J-just calm down, Shinobu!

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.920
YOU BIG JEEEEERK!

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.290
Where did Moroboshi go?

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:37.420
He's buried under there.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.080
Darling...

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.330
I'm sorry, darling.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.750
Yeah, sure. Whatever.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.130
Time for a cuddle!

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.750
Ugh! All of this crap
is seriously ruining my life!

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.040
<b>Cat & Caboodle Diner</b>

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.040
<b>Ramen                 Takoyaki</b>

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:33.710
Next up, it's time for our daily segment
on missing persons.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:34.830
Here's your order.
Next up, it's time for our daily segment<b>
</b>on missing persons.<b></b>

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.210
Next up, it's time for our daily segment
on missing persons.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.920
Please come home, Mommy!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.000
And now, we hear from another family.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:45.250
Oh darling! Where have you gone?!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.380
I know it's cold out there!

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.710
Come home and let me warm you up!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.830
Ataru! We won't give you a hard time,
so just come home!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.830
Oh Ataru!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.710
I had to attend a funeral the other day,

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:00.420
and I made sure to bring home a bunch of
those tasty funeral buns you love so much!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.960
Many of his friends have also gathered here
to share their concern.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.830
Hey Ataru! Please give me a call!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.500
I know that you don't want to go home to Lum!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.670
Crud! They're already looking for me
after I managed to slip away unnoticed!
A husband is supposed to stay by his wife's side!<b></b>

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:14.330
Crud! They're already looking for me
after I managed to slip away unnoticed!
Come to me and then let's elope somewhere far away!<b></b>

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.080
Don't even bother trying to hide!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:19.500
Because I can see exactly where you are!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.750
<b>CLATTER</b>

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.210
Today is a day of misfortune.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.670
And it's far worse than you think.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.170
Take a look, viewers.
This is a photograph of Ataru Moroboshi.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.790
Please call our hotline right away if you think
you may have seen him.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.040
Excuse me, sir...?
Any information on his whereabouts<b>
</b>is greatly appreciated.<b></b>

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.210
Thanks for the food!
Any information on his whereabouts<b>
</b>is greatly appreciated.<b></b>

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:32.670
Any information on his whereabouts
is greatly appreciated.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.880
Whoops, my bad.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:41.750
Sorry.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.380
What's the matter?!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:49.290
The shock of being bumped into...
has put too much strain on my heart...

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.830
H-holy moly, she's a certified hottie!

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.960
Are you still in pain, Miss?
Would a back massage help?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.170
Oh. Hold on, better idea!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.630
We can easily relieve the strain
on your heart by removing...

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:05.000
y-your bra!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:05.710
<b>SMACK!</b>

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:11.630
<b>It's Tasty!</b>

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:11.630
<b>Kinda</b>

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.710
You should stop being such a
thoughtless sleazeball.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.460
Then perhaps your bad luck will turn around.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.630
How did you know I have bad luck?!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.210
It's called physiognomy.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.170
One look at you told me everything.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.540
I've been a shrine maiden for many years now,

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:27.920
but I've never met anyone
as dreadfully cursed as you are.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.540
Oh yeah? So you're a shrine maiden!

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.880
That explains all the spiritual mumbo jumbo.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.170
Listen to me.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.080
You are ill-fated when it comes to women.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.290
Women?!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.580
Yeah... I'm seriously starting to think
I'm better off without 'em.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.790
Argh! My heart is acting up again!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.210
Let's hurry and get that bra off you!

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.130
<b>WHACK!</b>

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.130
You're just ASKING for trouble at this point!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:51.130
L-like I said earlier... you need to stop...

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.380
Oooooh, the pain!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:58.330
I gotta say, your words and actions are
sending totally opposite signals here, lady.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.790
Fine.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.080
I'll perform an exorcism for you...

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:08.290
My immense spiritual power
shall put an quick end to this.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:07.710
<b>Present For You</b>

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.880
<b>Demon Exterminators</b>

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.670
Mother... I'm back!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.580
Welcome home, Sakura!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.330
So, her name is Sakura!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.000
Hold up. Where have I heard that before...?

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.960
Oh my, do we have a guest?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.170
Something the matter?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.080
N-nope! I just, uh....

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.040
Gotta go! Bye!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.880
Where do think you're going?!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.080
Hurry, Mother! Capture that boy!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.040
Don't you dare run off
and waste my generosity!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.830
Or they'll be hell to pay!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.170
Sakura never stops once she
puts her mind to something, you see.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.130
She's always been in frail health,

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.460
but that hasn't stopped her
from being a great exorcist.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.420
Anyhoo, your face is so cursed

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.580
they could put a picture of it
in the dictionary for "unlucky"!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.710
You're in desperate need of an exorcism, my boy!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.920
Somebody help meeeeeeeeee!
You're in desperate need of an exorcism, my boy!<b></b>

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.630
Somebody help meeeeeeeeee!
Come right this way.<b></b>

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.540
Just leave me alone!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.750
Relax, Sakura will take care of you.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:14.630
No thanks!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:15.500
Ah! Wait!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.750
I'm outta here!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.630
We're trying to do you a favor
out of the kindness of our hearts!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.250
Have a little gratitude!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.540
Sakura! What happened to your face?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.170
It's just another jinx.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:32.380
I have a decayed tooth that suddenly
caused a massive canker sore.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.250
Ugh! I can't stand this!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.750
Let's get the exorcism over with
so I can go see the dentist!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:45.830
Unclean spirits and infernal invaders,
we drive you from us!

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:51.210
Unclean spirits and infernal invaders,
we drive you from....

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.000
AHH! GODDAMMIT!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.920
IT HURTS SO BAD!

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.210
Y-yikes...

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:00.960
I CAN'T FOCUS BECAUSE OF
ALL THE DAMN PAAAAAAIN!

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.460
Such a powerful aura!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.130
Wh-what the hell?!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.040
You're making things worse, you quack!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.500
Oh shut your mouth!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:15.710
Those demons are nothing to fear.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:18.630
I'll blow them to smithereens
with my spiritual power in no time!

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:24.080
Om! Knish gnash, yum yum, dim sum,
chow mein, mapo tofu...

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.880
chili shrimp, ramen, wonton, bouillon, poutine...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:34.380
extra garlic, extra veggies, pork fat,
soy sauce, salt n' pepper...

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:37.500
Crap, it's not working.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.080
Now I've got a migraine...

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:43.040
No matter! I can't afford to quit
until the job is finished!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.710
Sakura! Don't push yourself!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.330
You realize more of these freaks
keep popping up every time you stop, right?!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.460
N-no, my heart...!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.960
Oh you poor girl!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.830
I'm the one who could use
some sympathy here!

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.880
Wh-what's the matter?

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.880
I've been totally refreshed!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.710
For the first time in my life...
I feel healthy!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.380
Oh my gosh!
Then what about all these demons?

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.130
They were the cause of my illness!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.830
I'm finally free from their curse!

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.500
All the demons ditched you
to latch onto that boy instead!

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.790
What a wonderful turn of events, Sakura!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.790
Thank you, Mother!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.750
HEY!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.290
Just relax!
I'm going to finish the exorcism for you!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.830
You damn well better!

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:35.420
Jugemu, jugemu, goko-no-surikire,

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:39.880
kaijarisuigyo no suigyomatsu...

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.460
DEMONS BEGONE!

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.580
Wow, they're all going away...

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.210
<b>Slice</b>

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.040
The hell is that thing?!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.380
Uh oh... it's the Grim Reaper!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.920
Rest in peace.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:18.580
So, you managed to get rid of all the demons
that were causing her illness?

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:18.580
<b>Tomobiki Hospital</b>

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.830
You've always been worried about Sakura,
so I figured that we should let you know.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.130
What great news, Sakura!

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.130
Thank you, Uncle!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.080
But on the other hand...

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.130
That boy is more unlucky than ever before, huh?

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:37.290
Please don't die, Ataru!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.710
Darling!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.500
Oh Ataru!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.580
How could you abandon us like this?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.750
We wanted you back alive, you bonehead!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:47.830
Mr. Moroboshi?

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.540
The doctor would like to
speak with you for a moment...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.330
Hey pretty lady! Can I get your digits?
What's your address?

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:59.670
What's wrong, everybody?
You look like you've been crying.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.540
I don't even know why I bother anymore.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.040
How dare you....

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.080
YOU CHEATER!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.580
Darling! You're cheating on me again?!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.750
Take this!

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.750
<b>AAAAARGH</b>

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.750
There they go with the screaming again.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.210
The Moroboshis really need to do
something about their son.

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.830
How dreadful.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.330
Darling, you stupid jerk!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.000
Cherry. I need a favor.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.580
Ho ho? So you want me to
strip Lum of her powers, eh?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:41.330
I can't go a single day
without her electrocuting me!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:44.540
And whenever I try to run away,
she just comes flying right after me.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:49.000
It freakin' sucks! The best years of my life
are gonna be totally ruined!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.290
Guess what, I heard everything
that you just said!

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.210
Lum?!

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:55.130
You have some nerve treating me like
the bad guy after you cheated on me!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.670
Dammit! Quit stalking me everywhere!

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.830
You're not going anywhere, mister!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:11:59.500
Go away!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.670
Get back here!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.130
Darling!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.080
I see where he's coming from.
Darling!<b></b>

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.460
Darling!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:07.540
<b>Moroboshi</b>

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.080
Anybody home?

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.380
Coming!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.380
Oh, hello there!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.830
Good day.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.670
Is Ataru still alive and kicking?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:13.880
Well, get a load of this.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.920
He just came back home
looking about as dead as a doorknob!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:17.790
Ataru!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.290
Ataru!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.500
I guess you guys just constantly
talk shit behind my back, huh?

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.830
What kind of mother does that?!
And we're supposed to be friends, dude!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.170
Just ignore the hysterics.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.920
That boy has more than a few
screws loose these days.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.540
So, whaddya come to my house for?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.710
Well, Cherry sent me.
He told me to give you this.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:37.630
Oh yeah?!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.170
<b>Sakuranbo</b>

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.830
What's up with the yellow ribbon?

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.420
Dunno.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.420
Dear Ataru.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:49.920
Take the ribbon that I've included
and tie it around Lum's horns.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:54.460
Only the person who ties it
shall be able to remove it.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.920
"It will block out her Oni powers."

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.830
"I made this ribbon especially for you."

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.630
What are you two up to?

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.330
Hey Lum! Come here!

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.710
What are you holding in your hands there?

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.330
Well, it's something that Cherry...

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.420
Cherry what?

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.750
Just listen, Lum.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.630
This thing is called a ribbon.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.380
It's an accessory that girls on Earth
wear to look cute.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.670
Oh?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.250
Would you care to give it a little try?

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.920
Darling, your voice is cracking
for some reason.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.210
O-oh that?

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.170
It's just because the thought of seeing you
with the ribbon on gets me all flustered!

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.080
Ribbons are pretty lame though,
don't you think?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.210
Shut your stupid face!

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:36.790
Seeing his wife get prettied up
is the joy of every husband out there!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:40.250
Ah! My heart aches for just a quick glance
of my wife at her finest!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.710
Oh really?

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.080
Let me tie it on for you, kay?

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.080
Kay!

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:48.670
And it's done!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.380
Take a look, Lum.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.960
It looks better on her than expected!

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.880
How it looks isn't important.
As long as she wears it.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.290
I love it!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.460
I'm gonna go out for a bit and show it off!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.540
That hurt!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.420
Hey Lum! Are you all right?!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.670
It worked!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.960
<b>The Yellow Ribbon of Happiness</b>

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:34.170
What's going on? My body feels so heavy!

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:38.540
What exactly are we stalking her for?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.920
No real reason.

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.710
Oh! Hi, Lum!

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.790
What are you doing out here?

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.880
Uh, is something the matter, Lum?

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.250
You're staring at me awfully hard...

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.250
and um...

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.790
Baboooom!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.790
<b>BABOOOOM</b>

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.830
Lum just...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.500
GRABBED MY FREAKIN' HAND!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.540
I can't use my electric shock...

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:09.830
LUM, MY DEAR!

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:13.330
T-t-the truth is, I knew you were the girl for me
from the first time I laid eyes on...

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.710
KEEP IT IN YOUR PANTS, DUMBASS!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:17.000
Wh-what's going on?

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.040
Dude! Where the heck did you come from?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.250
Don't go all crazy just because
she held your hand!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.420
How else am I supposed to react
to her holding my hand?!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:23.710
Come on, this can't be the first time
someone's held your hand before!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.500
Let me try it one more time.
Come on, this can't be the first time<b>
</b>someone's held your hand before!<b></b>

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.710
Come on, this can't be the first time
someone's held your hand before!

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.630
Lum, my love!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.830
Just forget this loser
and let's go have some private...

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:33.210
Dumbass!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.250
Something wrong, Lum?

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.830
Why don't you just shock those idiots?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:41.000
Darling... I think I've gotten sick or something.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:41.920
What?!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:42.960
Seriously?!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.210
Wah!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.540
My body is all heavy and I can't fly!

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.540
And my electric shocks aren't working, either!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:51.830
Oh, Shinobu!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:55.080
Get a room. Nobody wants to see you two
all over each other in public.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.290
It's disgusting.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:59.540
Who cares what you think.
This is what married couples do!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.080
Right, darling?

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.250
Hey!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:05.540
My darling even gave me this cute ribbon, see?

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:07.250
I bet you're jealous!

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.170
Did you really, Ataru?!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.670
It's all true.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:13.210
Ataru even said he wanted to see
his wife at her finest.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.290
Don't tell her that! You backstabber!

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:19.630
Meanwhile, he's never bothered to
give me even a single bobby pin...

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.040
Screw you and your stupid ribbon!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.790
Did you just... cover for Lum?!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.250
Yippee!
Cut it out, Shinobu!<b></b>

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.880
I came here to give you some treats
that I baked earlier today...

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.040
But forget it.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.420
You clearly don't care.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.790
Shinobu!
Listen, I have a good reason for doi-

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:41.750
<b>CRACK</b>

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.540
Darling? What were you trying to say?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.540
Oh... it's nothing.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.670
We're gonna crash at your place
to make sure that Lum stays safe!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.250
Since Lum can't protect herself right now,

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:57.670
leaving her all alone with you
is a recipe for trouble!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:00.460
The way you idiots keep ogling her
is way more problematic!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.920
Darling... Just how long
are these guys going to stay?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.500
That's enough. Keep your distance.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.330
Ataru transforms into a full on sexbeast
after it gets dark, you know!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.080
I'm not some kinda werewolf, dammit!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:15.210
Tough luck! You won't be laying
a single finger on Lum tonight!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.710
Help me, darling!
Hurry and send these guys packing!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.000
Hey bozos!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.630
GO THE HELL HOME ALREADY!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.290
And stay out!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.290
This won't stop us!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.670
We'll keep watch on you from here!

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.540
Yeah, sure! Good luck with that!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.290
Shit!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.290
Oh darling! This makes me so happy!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.880
You usually give me the cold shoulder,

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:43.290
but I just knew that you'd fight for me
when the chips are down!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.500
C'mon, darling! It's bedtime!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.130
We're sleeping together tonight!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.210
Huh?!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.080
Being unable to fly has me feeling pretty blue.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.580
So I don't want us to be apart, darling.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.290
I'm going to stay by your side for life!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:04.290
FOR LIIIIIIIIIIFE?!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.630
<b>FOR LIFE</b>

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.080
I mean, I can't go back to
my spaceship anyway.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.460
So I'll have to make myself at home here.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.710
Lum! Take that ribbon off!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.750
Huh? No way!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.790
It's the first gift that you've
ever given me, darling!

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:18.790
Whatever! Just take it off!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:19.830
No! Stop!

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.630
Enough! Do what I say!
No! Stop!<b></b>

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.960
Lum is screaming for help!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.540
Ataru, you scumbag!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.290
Hold it right there!
What do you think you're doing?!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.500
Quit fighting back!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.920
No! No! Stop it!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:33.960
<b>THUD</b>

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.960
YOU PERV!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.960
KEEP YOUR FILTHY HANDS OFF OF LUM!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.080
What are you talking about?!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.540
Don't play dumb with us!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.290
We know exactly what's going on!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:43.790
Get out!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.500
You two are the only pervs here!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.500
Hey! Stop throwing my stuff!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:55.750
My darling loves and cherishes me
more than anyone!

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:01.920
What's this?

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.040
A letter from Cherry?

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.580
Dude! Don't read that!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.880
Let's see. "This ribbon will
block her Oni powers..."

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.580
You bastard!
You and Cherry were in cahoots?!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.210
Darling...?

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.500
L-Lum...

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.710
I can explain...

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:19.750
OUCH!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.170
Scratch! Scratch! Scratch! Scratch!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.170
<b>SCRATCH</b>

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:22.290
CHOMP!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:21.920
<b>CHOMP</b>

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:26.380
Calm down! Just take a chill pill!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.460
YOU DARE PLAY AROUND
WITH MY FEELINGS?!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.750
H-holy crap, she's a powerhouse...

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.630
The electric shocks almost seem cute
compared to that...

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.920
Hurry up! Take off the ribbon!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:43.250
Aw jeez! That's what I was
trying to do a minute ago!

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:52.290
It's been a hot minute
since I last gave you a good shock.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.830
So I've got plenty of energy
to spare right now!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.710
And once I'm done with you,

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.630
I'm gonna make sure Cherry
gets his just deserts too!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.170
H-hold up!
You could at least go see Cherry firs-

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.380
I sense a great disturbance is headed this way.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.580
NOW TAKE YOUR LUMPS!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:25.830
I think I shall stay at Sakura's house this evening.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.960
Kuwabara, kuwabara!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.960
<b>Note: A phrase used in Japanese to ward off lightning or other disasters.</b>

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:14.040
Are you absolutely certain that you'll
be okay on your own, Shutaro?!

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.790
Yes, Grandfather.

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:18.960
I shall lay my life on the line to study hard,

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.630
and make sure I do not bring any dishonor
to the Mendo Family crest.

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:34.080
Have a nice day, Young Master.

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:36.000
Thanks, you too.

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:38.040
Young Master. Please be careful.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:38.960
Sure.

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:45.380
Here I gooooooo! Bye!

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:50.960
<b>Trouble Rains Down!!</b>

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:50.960
<b>Amazed in a Maze</b>

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:48.380
Next time on Urusei Yatsura!

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.290
Why you cheeky little....!
